=\"27\"]https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358720/extras/53c062bc38fc59440d6e9ae53e6e51f2.webp?t=1760601605[/img]\r\n\r\n[imgvid poster.avif=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358720/extras/6d5d441bd83627bcbc6d2b8f8d15f0ff.poster.avif?t=1760601605\" webm=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358720/extras/6d5d441bd83627bcbc6d2b8f8d15f0ff.webm?t=1760601605\" width=\"1170\" height=\"438\"][/imgvid]\r\n[h2]• 奇偉壯麗，光怪陸離[/h2]\r\n別有世間曾未見，一行一步一花新。歡迎來到亦真亦幻的東方魔幻世界！\r\n天命人將前往引人入勝又風格迥異的多個西遊故地，再次譜寫前所未見的冒險史詩。\r\n\r\n\r\n[imgvid poster.avif=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358720/extras/50a130565eba20a23c614617374844e6.poster.avif?t=1760601605\" webm=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358720/extras/50a130565eba20a23c614617374844e6.webm?t=1760601605\" width=\"1170\" height=\"438\"][/imgvid]\r\n[h2]• 妖魔鬼怪，捲土重來[/h2]\r\n行者名聲大，魔王手段強。《西遊記》的一大看點正是各有所長的厲害妖怪。\r\n在冒險途中，天命人將遭遇許多強敵與可敬的對手，與其豪氣一戰，至死方休。\r\n\r\n\r\n[imgvid poster.avif=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358720/extras/cac7e67395cc9fbe1463054a2004496a.poster.avif?t=1760601605\" webm=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358720/extras/cac7e67395cc9fbe1463054a2004496a.webm?t=1760601605\" width=\"1170\" height=\"438\"][/imgvid]\r\n[h2]• 天搖地動，各顯神通[/h2]\r\n練就長生多少法，學來變化廣無邊。法術、變化、各式各樣的法寶，相生相剋，向來是中國神話裡最經典的戰鬥元素。\r\n天命人除了精通不同棍法，更能自由搭配多種法術神通、天賦、武器、披掛，找出最適合自己戰鬥風格的致勝之道。\r\n\r\n\r\n[imgvid poster.avif=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358720/extras/717266ac34d8670ca14c77550aad5787.poster.avif?t=1760601605\" webm=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358720/extras/717266ac34d8670ca14c77550aad5787.webm?t=1760601605\" width=\"1170\" height=\"438\"][/imgvid]\r\n[h2]• 千變萬象，蕩氣迴腸[/h2]\r\n六般體相六般兵，六樣形駭六樣情。敵人的凶惡狡猾只是表象，其來歷、個性、動機更加耐人尋味。\r\n戰鬥之餘，天命人也將探索各色人物背後的故事，瞭解他們的前世今生、愛恨情仇、貪嗔癡。","strSnippet":"《黑神話：悟空》是一款以中國神話為背景的動作角色扮演遊戲。在游戲中你將扮演一位“天命人”，爲了探尋昔日傳奇的真相，踏上一條充滿危險與驚奇的西游之路。"}}],["achievements",{"version":2,"data":{"vecHighlight":[],"vecUnachieved":[],"vecAchievedHidden":[],"nTotal":0,"nAchieved":0}}]]